    "created_at": "2018-02-14T16:09:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-14T16:09:01Z",
    "body": "IMO neither implementation is ideal. If the idea of a reset is to get back to the initial state when the page was first loaded, then I think a reset should set the cursor back to the start of the content (i.e. `(0, 0)`).",
